    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "undead",
        "subtype": "spirit"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Rakka.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 3, power rating 5 → CR 2 as a spellcaster. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Enigmatic Employer</strong> — Independent</p><p>Status: Unknown — operates from a hidden temple in the enchanted woods</p><p>Rakka is a mysterious figure who employs agents for dangerous retrieval missions from a hidden temple deep in the enchanted woods. Archie Miser worked for Rakka in the period leading up to the Swiftsoul incident, receiving payments for 'retrieval fees' and 'courier services.' Rakka may be connected to the teleportation that brought Archie to Swiftsoul, and the phrase 'Rakka silence protocol' in Archie's ledger suggests their relationship may have become dangerous.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Staff</strong> — “The Enigmatic Employer”</li><li><strong>Shadow Step</strong> — “Archie Miser worked for Rakka in the period leading up to the Swiftsoul incident, receiving payments for 'retrieval fees' and 'courier services.' Rakka may be connected to the teleportation that brought Archie to”</li><li><strong>Guild Spellcasting</strong> — “What IS known about Rakka: - They operate from a hidden temple deep in the enchanted woods, protected by magic that discourages outside contact - They employ agents for tasks requiring discretion, specific skills, and”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/rakka</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/rakka</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
